    {
      "code": "verify.refused",
      "description": "INVARIANT 3, the load-bearing one: an otherwise perfectly valid offer is refused, and nothing may touch the disk. Mutation-check this case by removing the refuse-on-fail branch from the gate; the test must go red.",
