  "description": "Verify-gate vectors. Run Gate(verifier, manifest, payload) where payload is the bytes of vectors/blobs/<payload_blob>, and assert the outcome. Gate order is 1) validate manifest 2) check payload length against manifest.payload.size 3) call the verifier; the ordering cases pin that precedence down.",
  "protocol_version": 2,
  "vectors_version": 1
